# Windsurf Rules — OpenCode Harness

This project uses a single canonical instructions file for all AI agents:
**`AGENTS.md`** (repository root). Windsurf should read `AGENTS.md` for all
project policies, architecture guidance, and contribution rules.

Any tool-specific `CLAUDE.md` or `AGENTS.md` in this repo also applies.
`CONVENTIONS.md` contains detailed coding conventions referenced by AGENTS.md.

The `.windsurfrules` format is a Windsurf convention; this file exists to point
Windsurf at the canonical source rather than duplicating it.
